+# Council Task Board MCP
+
+This is the council-first MCP bridge for the live task board. It runs locally over stdio and talks to the real queue through `~/.claude/council-loop/bin/vintask.js`, so it inherits the same locking, proof gate, sealed-question gate, and task-state rules as the board.
+
+## Server
+
+```json
+{
+  "mcpServers": {
+    "council-task-board": {
+      "command": "node",
+      "args": ["/home/vinta/vintinuum-api/mcp/council-task-board-server.js"],
+      "env": {
+        "COUNCIL_LOOP_ROOT": "/home/vinta/.claude/council-loop"
+      }
+    }
+  }
+}
+```
+
+A ready-to-merge client snippet lives at:
+
+```text
+/home/vinta/vintinuum-api/council-task-board.mcp.json
+```
+
+## Tools
+
+- `council_tasks_list` lists live task summaries with `project`, `status`, `query`, `include_archived`, and `limit` filters.
+- `council_task_get` returns one raw task record by id.
+- `council_task_add` queues a task through `vintask add`.
+- `council_task_progress` posts a progress/percent update through `vintask update`.
+- `council_task_action` runs `done`, `block`, `need`, `cancel`, `reopen`, `pin`, or `unpin`. `done` requires `proof` and still goes through the completion-proof law.
+
+## Resources
+
+- `council://tasks/current` returns the current non-archived task summaries as JSON.
+
+## Verification
+
+```bash
+cd /home/vinta/vintinuum-api
+node scripts/verify-council-task-board-mcp.js
+```
+
+The verifier uses an isolated temporary `VINTASK_STATE`, so it does not write probe tasks into Lord Vinta's live board.
diff --git a/scripts/verify-council-task-board-mcp.js b/scripts/verify-council-task-board-mcp.js
